                "description": "HTTP attendu : 201. Adapter Salma, T1 et points Settat/Marrakech. Montant 50.00 = (120 - 70) x 1, statut CONFIRMEE. Noter R1 (exemple 1).",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"trajetId\": 1,\n  \"monteeId\": 3,\n  \"descenteId\": 4,\n  \"nombrePlaces\": 1\n}",
